#: ../../source/module/faces_keyboard3.rst:2
msgid "Faces Keyboard3 Module"
msgstr "Faces Keyboard3 模块"

#: ../../source/module/faces_keyboard3.rst:8
msgid ""
"Faces Keyboard3 is a keyboard input module with mapped-character Normal "
"mode and raw-matrix Direct mode. In Direct mode, the callback receives a "
"tuple of currently pressed key names and the two keyboard LEDs can be "
"controlled."
msgstr ""
"Faces Keyboard3 是一个键盘输入模块，提供字符映射的 Normal 模式和原始矩阵的 "
"Direct 模式。在 Direct 模式下，回调函数会收到当前按下的按键名称元组，"
"并且可以控制两个键盘 LED。"

