#: ../../source/module/faces_keyboard3.rst:22
msgid ""
"This example uses Normal mode and reports each mapped key on the CoreS3 "
"display."
msgstr "该示例使用 Normal 模式，并在 CoreS3 显示屏上报告映射后的按键。"

#: ../../source/module/faces_keyboard3.rst:27
msgid "Open the |faces_keyboard3_cores3_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |faces_keyboard3_cores3_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/module/faces_keyboard3.rst:30
msgid "MicroPython Example"
msgstr "MicroPython 应用示例"

#: ../../source/module/faces_keyboard3.rst:35
msgid ""
"Normal mode maps key presses to character codes. Direct mode reports a "
"tuple of currently pressed matrix-key names and also allows LED control."
msgstr "Normal 模式将按键映射为字符编码。Direct 模式报告当前按下的矩阵按键名称元组，"
"并支持 LED 控制。"

