#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:1 of
msgid "Set a keyboard LED effect in Direct mode."
msgstr "在 Direct 模式下设置键盘 LED 效果。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:3 of
msgid "Effects correspond to the keyboard firmware states and LED patterns:"
msgstr "效果对应键盘固件状态和 LED 模式："

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:5 of
msgid "``LED_EFFECT_1``: ``aA`` single press; left LED stays on."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_1``：``aA`` 单击；左侧 LED 常亮。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:6 of
msgid "``LED_EFFECT_2``: ``aA`` double-press lock; left LED blinks every 500 ms."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_2``：``aA`` 双击锁定；左侧 LED 每 500 ms 闪烁一次。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:7 of
msgid "``LED_EFFECT_3``: ``ALT`` active; left LED blinks every 150 ms."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_3``：``ALT`` 激活；左侧 LED 每 150 ms 闪烁一次。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:8 of
msgid "``LED_EFFECT_4``: ``FN`` single press; right LED stays on."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_4``：``FN`` 单击；右侧 LED 常亮。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:9 of
msgid "``LED_EFFECT_5``: ``FN`` double-press lock; right LED blinks every 500 ms."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_5``：``FN`` 双击锁定；右侧 LED 每 500 ms 闪烁一次。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:10 of
msgid ""
"``LED_EFFECT_6``: ``SYM`` double-press lock; right LED blinks every 150 "
"ms."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_6``：``SYM`` 双击锁定；右侧 LED 每 150 ms 闪烁一次。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:11 of
msgid "``LED_EFFECT_7``: ``SYM`` single press; LEDs alternate every 500 ms."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_7``：``SYM`` 单击；两侧 LED 每 500 ms 交替闪烁。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:12 of
msgid "``LED_EFFECT_8``: External effect; LEDs alternate every 200 ms."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_8``：外部效果；两侧 LED 每 200 ms 交替闪烁。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_led_effect:14 of
msgid "One of the ``LED_EFFECT_*`` constants."
msgstr "``LED_EFFECT_*`` 常量之一。"

