#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_callback:1 of
msgid "Set the key callback."
msgstr "设置按键回调。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_callback:3 of
msgid ""
"In Normal mode, the callback receives an integer key code. In Direct "
"mode, it receives a tuple containing the currently pressed key names. "
"Pass ``None`` to disable the callback."
msgstr "在 Normal 模式下，回调函数会收到整数按键编码。在 Direct 模式下，"
"回调函数会收到包含当前按下按键名称的元组。传入 ``None`` 可禁用回调。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.set_callback:7 of
msgid "Callable accepting the key event value, or ``None``."
msgstr "接收按键事件值或 ``None`` 的可调用对象。"

#: module.faces.FacesKeyboard3Module.tick:1 of
msgid "Poll once and schedule the callback for a new key event."
msgstr "轮询一次，并为新的按键事件调度回调。"

