"In Normal mode, ``KEY_BACKSPACE`` is ``0x08``, ``KEY_ENTER`` is ``0x0D``,"
" and ``KEY_DELETE`` is ``0x7F``. LED effects and manual LED states are "
"available only in Direct mode."
